#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:14
#: a35ca21a2e4549ed833c96ed86c199ab
msgid ""
"This topic shows how to connect the RC inputs to the APM2.x controller "
"board."
msgstr "本主题介绍如何将 RC 输入连接到 APM2.x 控制板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:18
#: 1270296660ae469b8bb24aed977130c4
msgid "Connecting a Receiver"
msgstr "连接接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:20
#: 56ed22e59fd545158804b61f180b767e
msgid ""
"Connect your RC receiver \"S\" (signal) pins to the \"S\" pins on Inputs of "
"APM using a (minimum 5 pin) `jumper cable (6-pin-to-6-pin-individual-"
"female-15cm) <http://dronefever.com/Jumper-cable-6-pin-to-6-pin-individual-"
"female-15cm.html>`__. You must connect at least channels 1 ~ 5.  Channels 6 "
"~ 8 are optional."
msgstr ""
"使用（至少 5 针） `跳线（6 针转 6 针单独母头 15cm） <http://dronefever.com/Jumper-cable-6-pin-"
"to-6-pin-individual-female-15cm.html>`__ 将 RC 接收机的「S」（信号）引脚连接到 APM "
"输入的「S」引脚。您至少必须连接第 1～5 通道。第 6～8 通道是可选的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:28
#: 9b37f07f30134dda8eee4dc66770ec3c
msgid ""
"Your RC receiver will require power. Normally this is done by using one 2 or"
" 3 wire connector between the APM Inputs and one channel output on the "
"receiver. See :ref:`APM Power Details <common-"
"apm25-and-26-overview_powering_the_apm2>` for limitations and important "
"warnings."
msgstr ""
"您的 RC 接收机需要供电。通常使用 APM 输入和接收机的一个通道输出之间的 2 或 3 针连接器实现。有关限制和重要警告，请参阅 :ref:`APM"
" 电源详情 <common-apm25-and-26-overview_powering_the_apm2>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:39
#: 557e8f0c9e204cfaa027b35287a0363f
msgid "Connecting a PPM Sum Receiver"
msgstr "连接 PPM Sum 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:41
#: 817ffa98df4443bfa2ca12a8495c6d82
msgid ""
"PPM receivers transmit all the channel information above through a single "
"port (some will transmit additional channels - for example the FrSky D8RSP "
"receiver outputs 7 PWM channels, while in CPPM mode it will output 8)."
msgstr ""
"PPM 接收机通过单个端口传输上述所有通道信息（部分会传输额外通道——例如 FrSky D8RSP 接收机输出 7 个 PWM 通道，在 CPPM "
"模式下将输出 8 个）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:46
#: e447d2ea97e2424585a7751c9cf6fbff
msgid ""
"On APM2 you can use PPM input by putting a `jumper "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9044>`__ on the RC inputs for channel 2 "
"and 3 (just the signal pins). PPM input from the receiver should be fed into"
" channel 1."
msgstr ""
"在 APM2 上，可以通过在第 2 和第 3 通道的 RC 输入（仅信号引脚）上放置 `跳线 "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9044>`__ 来使用 PPM 输入。来自接收机的 PPM 输入应接入第 1 "
"通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:54
#: 0bd9dc82cb77444ca3a6ae39f61528f8
msgid ""
"If you need to rearrange the channel order when using PPM and are unable to "
"do this from the transmitter, you can do this with the RCMAP Advanced "
"parameters. Read more about them :ref:`here <parameters_RCMAP_>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您在使用 PPM 时需要重新排列通道顺序，且无法从发射机上完成，可以通过 RCMAP 高级参数实现。在 :ref:`此处 "
"<parameters_RCMAP_>` 了解更多信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:61
#: 21013a5c750846949a9eefb829290485
msgid ""
"Copter 2.8.1 and earlier versions required you use a transmitter/receiver "
"combination that outputs at least 8 channels of ppm information. This is "
"resolved in version 2.9 so receivers like this should work."
msgstr ""
"Copter 2.8.1 及更早版本要求使用能输出至少 8 个 PPM 通道信息的发射机/接收机组合。此问题在 2.9 "
"版本中已解决，因此此类接收机应该可以正常工作。"
